  "rules": {
    "advance": "One normal Advance. When unlocked aggregated Skip_Value>=1, consume one Unity Random.value. If roll*100<Skip_Value, advance a temporary candidate once. Accept only candidateStage*10+candidateLevel<old Stage_Value_Max. Then update maximum from resulting current wave. No chain or chance clamp.",
    "rewards": "One real win mission increment. Skipped wave has no killed-tree income, tree mission increment or extra win mission. No diamond award.",
    "notification": "Private transient flag at Tree_manager+0x50. Game_Start sets GameSkip_UI active from it and clears it. Original GameWin_0 controller/Win_0 clip moves/scales Panel for1.5s. It has no disable event; next Game_Start controls root. Loading clears Win/Fail/Loading after0.2s, not the skip root.",
    "scrolling": "Start caches RawImage on same object. Update offsets uvRect.x/y by original serialized Speed times scaled Time.deltaTime; width/height retained, no modulo, no OnEnable reset. Original three banners Speed(-0.1,0), uv width26.2."
  },
